  SOV_attack_of_the_dead_men_1915_desc:0 "Subjected to deadly chlorine and bromine gas at Osowiec, surviving Russian soldiers of the 13th Company charge with bloody bandages, coughing up pieces of their own lungs, routing 7,000 terrified Germans."
  SOV_russian_chemical_flamethrowers:0 "Tovarnitski Portable Flamethrowers"
  SOV_russian_chemical_flamethrowers_desc:0 "Equip shock assault companies with portable compressed-gas flamethrowers designed by military engineer Tovarnitski, clearing machine gun bunkers with jets of liquid fire."
  SOV_optical_rangefinders_and_periscopes:0 "Trench Periscopes and Optical Rangefinders"
  SOV_optical_rangefinders_and_periscopes_desc:0 "Manufacture precision trench periscopes and coincidence rangefinders at the Obukhov optical shops, allowing forward observers to direct indirect artillery fire without exposing their heads."
  SOV_motono_sazonov_treaty_1916:0 "The Russo-Japanese Treaty of 1916"
  SOV_motono_sazonov_treaty_1916_desc:0 "Former enemies unite in mutual defense: Foreign Minister Sazonov and Viscount Motono sign a defensive alliance, securing our Pacific flank and shipping Japanese heavy artillery to Russia."
  SOV_murmansk_convoys_arrival:0 "Arrival of the Arctic Allied Convoys"
  SOV_murmansk_convoys_arrival_desc:0 "Allied merchant fleets laden with British Armstrong shells, French airplanes, and American raw rubber steam safely into the deep ice-free berths of Romanov-on-Murman."
  SOV_red_cross_missions_to_serbia:0 "Red Cross Sanitary Trains to Serbia"
- SOV_red_cross_missions_to_serbia_desc:0 "Dispatch hundreds of Russian doctors, nurses, and hospital trains to Kragujevac to combat typhus epidemics and treat wounded Serbian soldiers in brotherly love."
