+ SOV_red_cross_missions_to_serbia_desc:0 "Dispatch hundreds of Russian doctors, nurses, and hospital trains to Kragujevac to combat typhus epidemics and treat wounded Serbian soldiers in brotherly love."
+ SOV_annexation_of_tsargrad:0 "The Annexation of Tsargrad"
+ SOV_annexation_of_tsargrad_desc:0 "The ancient dream of Byzantium is fulfilled! The Cross shines once more upon the dome of Hagia Sophia, and the Russian Empire secures unbroken command over the Bosphorus and the Dardanelles. Tsargrad has returned to Orthodox Christendom, cementing our divine mandate as the Third Rome."
+ SOV_triumph_of_the_romanov_dynasty:0 "Triumph of the Romanov Dynasty"
+ SOV_triumph_of_the_romanov_dynasty_desc:0 "Having vanquished all foreign foes, weathered the trials of internal discord, and restored glory to the Russian realm, the House of Romanov stands triumphant. The autocratic crown shines with unprecedented majesty across a continent-spanning empire from the Vistula to the Pacific."
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/WW1/localisation/english/ww1_russia_ideas_l_english.yml b/WW1/localisation/english/ww1_russia_ideas_l_english.yml
index 15361a9..b49ad86 100644
--- a/WW1/localisation/english/ww1_russia_ideas_l_english.yml
+++ b/WW1/localisation/english/ww1_russia_ideas_l_english.yml
@@ -136,10 +136,98 @@ SOV_goremykin_reactionary_cabinet:0 "Goremykin Reactionary Cabinet"
  SOV_sukhomlinov_administration_tier3:0 "Overhauled Military Districts"
  SOV_sukhomlinov_administration_tier3_desc:0 "The reorganization of European Russia into unified military districts with integrated logistics has restored tactical morale and cut mobilization delays in half."
  SOV_modern_imperial_general_staff:0 "Modern Imperial General Staff"
  SOV_modern_imperial_general_staff_desc:0 "Through methodical pre-war reforms, doctrine overhauls, and staff coordination, the Russian Imperial Army has eliminated bureaucratic paralysis and established an agile, modern high command."
  SOV_shell_shortage_stage_2:0 "Shell Famine: Industrial Mobilization"
  SOV_shell_shortage_stage_2_desc:0 "Through the Special Council for Defense and War Industries Committees (VPK), domestic arms production surges, though artillery units still face ammunition rationing."
  SOV_shell_shortage_stage_3:0 "Shell Famine: Arctic Supply Lifeline"
  SOV_shell_shortage_stage_3_desc:0 "Allied munitions shipments through Archangelsk and the new Murmansk railway ease the acute deficit, leaving only minor ammunition constraints."
  SOV_vpk_mobilization_spirit:0 "War Industries Committees (VPK)"
  SOV_vpk_mobilization_spirit_desc:0 "Private manufacturing works and local municipal workshops are mobilized into state shell contracts to supply the frontline armies."
+ SOV_strategic_depth_and_rasputitsa:0 "Strategic Depth & The Rasputitsa"
+ SOV_strategic_depth_and_rasputitsa_desc:0 "The colossal territorial depth of the Russian Empire and the seasonal mud of the rasputitsa turn any hostile invasion into an agonizing logistical nightmare. Invading armies are inexorably ground down by vast distances, brutal winter cold, and impassable quagmires."
+ SOV_order_restored_spirit:0 "Triumph of Imperial Order"
+ SOV_order_restored_spirit_desc:0 "Through rigorous administrative vigilance, decisive food logistics, and unwavering frontline loyalty, the revolutionary conspiracy has been extinguished. The throne is secure, and peace reigns across the empire."
+ SOV_aviation_school_program:0 "Imperial Aviation Officer Schools"
+ SOV_aviation_school_program_desc:0 "Standardized aeronautical instruction programs at Gatchina and Sevastopol prepare pilots in aerial tactics, engine maintenance, and combat navigation."
+ SOV_aviation_combat_school:0 "Advanced Combat Flight Academy"
+ SOV_aviation_combat_school_desc:0 "Intensive dogfighting maneuvers, formation tactics, and live-fire gunnery training for Russian military aviators."
+ SOV_ace_training_system:0 "Imperial Ace Pilot Doctrine"
+ SOV_ace_training_system_desc:0 "Fostering individual pilot initiative and aggressive aerial marksmanship inspired by legendary aces like Alexander Kazakov."
+ SOV_aerial_recon_network:0 "Corps Aerial Reconnaissance Network"
+ SOV_aerial_recon_network_desc:0 "Systematic aerial photography and artillery spotting squadrons directly attached to army corps headquarters provide real-time battlefield intelligence."
+ SOV_air_naval_coordination:0 "Black Sea Air-Naval Spotting"
+ SOV_air_naval_coordination_desc:0 "Seaplane carriers and maritime air patrols directing long-range naval bombardments against Ottoman coastal batteries and Bosphorus fortifications."
+ SOV_integrated_air_service:0 "Imperial Military Air Fleet (EVF)"
+ SOV_integrated_air_service_desc:0 "A fully integrated, autonomous air arm equipped with Ilya Muromets heavy bombers, scouts, and pursuit squadrons operating under centralized staff command."
+ SOV_southwestern_preparation:0 "Preparation for the Southwestern Offensive"
+ SOV_southwestern_preparation_desc:0 "General Brusilov's meticulously organized assault preparations, digging advanced saps close to Austro-Hungarian trenches and drilling shock formations."
+ SOV_southwestern_offensive:0 "The Brusilov Breakthrough"
+ SOV_southwestern_offensive_desc:0 "Simultaneous shock attacks along the entire Southwestern Front shattering the Austro-Hungarian Fourth and Seventh Armies in a display of tactical brilliance."
+ SOV_southwestern_exhaustion:0 "Post-Breakthrough Exhaustion"
+ SOV_southwestern_exhaustion_desc:0 "Heavy casualties and logistical depletion following the intensive operations in Galicia and Volhynia require operational consolidation."
+ SOV_serbian_medical_mission:0 "Russian Imperial Red Cross in Serbia"
+ SOV_serbian_medical_mission_desc:0 "Medical detachments, field hospitals, and epidemic relief missions aiding Serbian allied forces on the Balkan front in Christian brotherhood."
+ WHT_provisional_all_russian_government:0 "All-Russian Provisional Government"
+ WHT_provisional_all_russian_government_desc:0 "The unified civil authority claiming legitimate sovereignty over all territories of the former Russian Empire."
+ WHT_trans_siberian_artery:0 "Trans-Siberian Lifeline"
+ WHT_trans_siberian_artery_desc:0 "Continuous rail convoys along the Trans-Siberian corridor transport supplies from Pacific harbors to the Urals front."
+ WHT_supreme_ruler_authority:0 "Authority of the Supreme Ruler"
+ WHT_supreme_ruler_authority_desc:0 "Admiral Kolchak's supreme military mandate centralizes civil and military power in defense of the fatherland."
+ WHT_ice_march_heroism:0 "Spirit of the Ice March"
+ WHT_ice_march_heroism_desc:0 "The sacrificial heroism of the initial winter campaigns inspires White volunteers with an unbending determination to endure."
+ WHT_volunteer_officer_spirit:0 "Volunteer Officer Ethos"
+ WHT_volunteer_officer_spirit_desc:0 "Battalions of dedicated officers fight as common infantrymen, providing peerless tactical assault capabilities."
+ WHT_denikin_general_command:0 "Denikin's Strategic High Command"
+ WHT_denikin_general_command_desc:0 "Methodical planning and orthodox military doctrine coordinating simultaneous army group maneuvers toward central Russia."
+ WHT_cossack_allegiance:0 "Cossack Host Alliances"
+ WHT_cossack_allegiance_desc:0 "Traditional Cossack horsemen provide fierce cavalry formations that dominate open plains and strike terror into enemy rear lines."
+ WHT_shock_officer_regiments:0 "Elite Colored Shock Regiments"
+ WHT_shock_officer_regiments_desc:0 "The Kornilov, Markov, and Drozdovsky regiments lead every breakthrough assault with unmatched bravery."
+ WHT_moscow_directive_spirit:0 "The Moscow Directive Drive"
+ WHT_moscow_directive_spirit_desc:0 "All resources and divisions are concentrated upon a single glorious objective: the liberation of the holy city of Moscow."
+ WHT_wrangel_agrarian_order:0 "Wrangel's Agrarian Settlements"
+ WHT_wrangel_agrarian_order_desc:0 "Pragmatic land laws win the active support of small-holding peasants and guarantee agricultural supplies for the army."
+ WHT_reorganized_russian_army:0 "Reorganized Russian Army"
+ WHT_reorganized_russian_army_desc:0 "Professional command structures, unified supply standards, and strict military discipline under General Baron Wrangel."
+ WHT_british_military_mission:0 "British Military Assistance"
+ WHT_british_military_mission_desc:0 "Generous shipments of British uniforms, Lee-Enfield rifles, and military advisors bolster our operational effectiveness."
+ WHT_french_munitions_pipeline:0 "French Munitions Pipeline"
+ WHT_french_munitions_pipeline_desc:0 "French naval convoys transport artillery ammunition and equipment through Black Sea ports."
+ WHT_stevens_railway_mission:0 "Stevens' American Railway Corps"
+ WHT_stevens_railway_mission_desc:0 "American engineering expertise drastically improves locomotive turnaround times and railway capacity."
+ WHT_entente_diplomatic_recognition:0 "Entente Diplomatic Recognition"
+ WHT_entente_diplomatic_recognition_desc:0 "Official liaison with the Allied Supreme War Council grants international legitimacy and opens overseas credit lines."
+ WHT_arsenal_of_democracy_aid:0 "Allied Material Deliveries"
+ WHT_arsenal_of_democracy_aid_desc:0 "Steady streams of Allied machine tools, trucks, and small arms flow through our maritime supply hubs."
+ WHT_russia_one_and_indivisible_spirit:0 "Russia, One and Indivisible"
+ WHT_russia_one_and_indivisible_spirit_desc:0 "Uncompromising defense of the territorial integrity and sovereign unity of the Russian State."
+ WHT_republican_constitution:0 "Republican Constitutional Legitimacy"
+ WHT_republican_constitution_desc:0 "A commitment to universal suffrage, civic freedoms, and an accountable legislative assembly."
+ WHT_supreme_military_dictate:0 "Iron Military Dictatorship"
+ WHT_supreme_military_dictate_desc:0 "Uncompromising executive dictatorship enforcing absolute civil obedience and eliminating subversive disruption."
+ WHT_restored_state_gendarmerie:0 "State Security & Gendarmerie"
+ WHT_restored_state_gendarmerie_desc:0 "Vigilant counter-espionage agents root out clandestine revolutionary cells and preserve order across liberated cities."
+ WHT_crowned_regency:0 "Supreme Crowned Regency"
+ WHT_crowned_regency_desc:0 "A traditional regency council prepares for the restoration of legitimate Christian monarchy in Russia."
+ WHT_holy_orthodox_symphonia:0 "Orthodox Spiritual Symphonia"
+ WHT_holy_orthodox_symphonia_desc:0 "Harmonious unity between church authority and state power revitalizes the spiritual soul of the Russian nation."
+ SOV_duma_and_court_politics:0 "Imperial Duma & Court Politics"
+ SOV_duma_and_court_politics_desc:0 "Manage relations between the State Duma, the conservative State Council, and the Imperial Court."
+ SOV_convene_imperial_duma:0 "Convene the Imperial State Duma"
+ SOV_convene_imperial_duma_desc:0 "Call the State Duma into session to rally national unity and debate emergency war appropriations."
+ SOV_prorogue_the_duma:0 "Prorogue the State Duma"
+ SOV_prorogue_the_duma_desc:0 "Issue an imperial ukase temporarily suspending the Duma to curb subversive rhetoric and liberal criticism."
+ SOV_conspiracy_rasputin:0 "Remove Court Intrigues"
+ SOV_conspiracy_rasputin_desc:0 "Purge the influence of irresponsible courtiers and shadowy confidants from the imperial residence."
+ SOV_establish_vpk_committees:0 "Establish Regional VPK Committees"
+ SOV_establish_vpk_committees_desc:0 "Organize regional War Industries Committees to coordinate factories and subcontract shell manufacture."
+ SOV_mobilize_machine_shops:0 "Convert Private Workshops to Munitions"
+ SOV_mobilize_machine_shops_desc:0 "Re-tool provincial metalworking and lathe workshops into specialized shell and fuse production."
+ SOV_zemgor_medical_union:0 "Support the Zemgor Union"
+ SOV_zemgor_medical_union_desc:0 "Fund the joint committee of Zemstvos and Town Councils to provide medical trains and frontline supplies."
+ SOV_british_shell_presses:0 "Procure British Shell Presses"
+ SOV_british_shell_presses_desc:0 "Import modern hydraulic shell-forging presses and tooling machinery from Britain via Archangelsk."
+ SOV_evacuate_industrial_machinery:0 "Evacuate Western Industrial Machinery"
+ SOV_evacuate_industrial_machinery_desc:0 "Dismantle manufacturing machinery and railway rolling stock from frontline western provinces and relocate them eastward."
+ SOV_prepare_southwestern_offensive:0 "Prepare the Southwestern Front Offensive"
+ SOV_prepare_southwestern_offensive_desc:0 "Stockpile artillery ammunition, concentrate shock corps, and plan surprise breakthroughs across the Galician lines."
