@@ -0,0 +1,195 @@
+﻿l_english:
+ SOV_all_power_to_the_soviets:0 "All Power to the Soviets!"
+ SOV_all_power_to_the_soviets_desc:0 "The bourgeois Provisional Government has fallen into irrecoverable bankruptcy. Power across Russia belongs exclusively to the Councils of Workers', Soldiers', and Peasants' Deputies!"
+ SOV_decree_on_land:0 "Decree on Land"
+ SOV_decree_on_land_desc:0 "Private ownership of land is abolished forever without compensation. All landed estates, crown domains, and monastery properties are placed at the disposal of volost land committees and district soviets."
+ SOV_establish_the_vecheka:0 "Founding of the All-Russian Cheka (VeCheka)"
+ SOV_establish_the_vecheka_desc:0 "To combat counter-revolution, sabotage, and speculation, the Council of People's Commissars institutes the Extraordinary Commission under the unbending stewardship of Felix Dzerzhinsky."
+ SOV_war_communism_decrees:0 "War Communism Decrees"
+ SOV_war_communism_decrees_desc:0 "The existential peril of civil war demands emergency economic mobilization. Extreme centralization, abolition of private enterprise, and absolute state control over all resources must fuel the revolutionary front."
+ SOV_grain_requisition_detachments:0 "Grain Requisition Detachments (Prodrazvyorstka)"
+ SOV_grain_requisition_detachments_desc:0 "Armed workers' food detachments (prodotryady) are mobilized to seize agricultural surpluses from the kulaks to guarantee bread for the starving cities and frontline Red Army divisions."
+ SOV_revolutionary_tribunals:0 "Revolutionary Tribunals"
+ SOV_revolutionary_tribunals_desc:0 "Swift, uncompromising revolutionary justice replaces bourgeois jurisprudence. Class instinct and the defense of the Soviet Republic guide the rulings of the workers' tribunals."
+ SOV_militarization_of_labor:0 "Militarization of Labor"
+ SOV_militarization_of_labor_desc:0 "Under Trotsky's doctrine, industrial workers are organized like military formations. Deserters from the labor front face the same stern discipline as deserters from the battlefield."
+ SOV_communist_subbotniks:0 "Communist Subbotniks"
+ SOV_communist_subbotniks_desc:0 "Voluntary, unpaid labor on weekends—hailed by Lenin as the 'Great Beginning'—channels proletarian enthusiasm into clearing rail yards, repairing rolling stock, and producing emergency armaments."
+ SOV_the_red_terror:0 "Decree on the Red Terror"
+ SOV_the_red_terror_desc:0 "Following the assassination attempts on Lenin and the slaying of Uritsky, the Soviet Republic unleashes class terror against White conspirators, foreign agents, and counter-revolutionary saboteurs."
+ SOV_nationalization_of_heavy_industry:0 "Nationalization of Heavy Industry"
+ SOV_nationalization_of_heavy_industry_desc:0 "All metallurgical combines, coal mines, textile complexes, and machine factories are brought under direct state ownership and the management of the Supreme Council of National Economy (VSNKh)."
+ SOV_worker_food_rationing_cards:0 "Class-Based Rationing System"
+ SOV_worker_food_rationing_cards_desc:0 "Food rations are strictly distributed by class category: heavy industrial workers and soldiers receive first priority, while the former bourgeoisie receives only the barest minimum."
+ SOV_eradicate_counter_revolutionary_cells:0 "Liquidate Counter-Revolutionary Conspiracies"
+ SOV_eradicate_counter_revolutionary_cells_desc:0 "The Cheka mercilessly infiltrates and dismantles underground monarchist circles, foreign espionage rings, and Right SR terrorist networks operating within Soviet territory."
+ SOV_central_transport_board_glavtrans:0 "Central Transport Board (Glavtrans)"
+ SOV_central_transport_board_glavtrans_desc:0 "Centralized command over every locomotive, boxcar, and rail depot ensures that Red Army reinforcements and munitions trains maintain non-stop priority over all civilian movement."
+ SOV_smash_the_tambov_rebellion:0 "Suppress the Tambov Green Insurgency"
+ SOV_smash_the_tambov_rebellion_desc:0 "Alexander Antonov's peasant rebellion in Tambov threatens the core agricultural breadbasket. Red Army shock divisions under Tukhachevsky deploy ruthless countermeasures to restore Soviet control."
+ SOV_kronstadt_reckoning:0 "The Kronstadt Reckoning"
+ SOV_kronstadt_reckoning_desc:0 "When the mutinous sailors of Kronstadt turn against the party with utopian demands, the Tenth Party Congress marches across the frozen Gulf of Finland to restore revolutionary order."
+ SOV_triumph_of_the_proletarian_dictatorship:0 "Triumph of the Proletarian Dictatorship"
+ SOV_triumph_of_the_proletarian_dictatorship_desc:0 "Through iron discipline, sacrificial devotion, and ruthless vigilance, the Soviet Republic has crushed domestic counter-revolution and established an unshakeable workers' state."
+ SOV_workers_and_peasants_red_army:0 "Workers' and Peasants' Red Army (RKKA)"
+ SOV_workers_and_peasants_red_army_desc:0 "Decreed by the Sovnarkom, a regular, disciplined revolutionary army replaces irregular Red Guard militias to wage professional warfare against imperialist and White armies."
+ SOV_the_revvoyensovyet:0 "The Revolutionary Military Council (Revvoyensoviet)"
+ SOV_the_revvoyensovyet_desc:0 "Headed by Leon Trotsky, the Revvoyensoviet centralizes operational, strategic, and political control over all fronts, fleets, and military districts of the Republic."
+ SOV_recruit_tsarist_voenspetsy:0 "Recruit Tsarist Military Specialists (Voenspetsy)"
+ SOV_recruit_tsarist_voenspetsy_desc:0 "Overcoming radical opposition, the party enlists tens of thousands of experienced former imperial officers and staff generals, utilizing their professional expertise under strict commissar oversight."
+ SOV_institution_of_political_commissars:0 "Dual Command: Military Commissars"
+ SOV_institution_of_political_commissars_desc:0 "Every field commander is paired with a dedicated political commissar. No order is valid without the commissar's countersignature, guaranteeing unswerving political loyalty to the Bolshevik cause."
+ SOV_armored_train_command:0 "Trotsky's Armored Train Command"
+ SOV_armored_train_command_desc:0 "Trotsky's legendary train—equipped with printing presses, telegraphs, machine guns, and elite shock guards—races along Russian rail lines to revive fighting spirit and turn the tide on critical sectors."
+ SOV_red_officer_courses_vystrel:0 "Vystrel Red Commanders Courses"
+ SOV_red_officer_courses_vystrel_desc:0 "Accelerated tactical schools promote devoted workers and peasant soldiers to officer ranks, forging a new generation of commanders unconditionally loyal to the Soviet power."
+ SOV_conscription_of_the_toilers:0 "Universal Conscription of Toilers"
+ SOV_conscription_of_the_toilers_desc:0 "Universal military service is imposed upon the working classes, swelling the ranks of the Red Army to over five million soldiers across European Russia and Siberia."
+ SOV_the_first_cavalry_army:0 "Form the 1st Cavalry Army (Konarmiya)"
+ SOV_the_first_cavalry_army_desc:0 "Under Semyon Budyonny and Kliment Voroshilov, the Konarmiya concentrates thousands of revolutionary horsemen into a ferocious, mobile operational strike force that shatters White flanks."
+ SOV_tachanka_warfare:0 "Tachanka Mobile Firepower"
+ SOV_tachanka_warfare_desc:0 "Mounting Maxim heavy machine guns onto lightweight, horse-drawn peasant carriages creates a devastating mobile weapons platform that dominates the vast steppes of southern Russia and Ukraine."
+ SOV_arsenals_of_tula_and_izhevsk:0 "Arsenals of Tula and Izhevsk"
+ SOV_arsenals_of_tula_and_izhevsk_desc:0 "The historic arms factories of Tula, Petrograd, and Izhevsk operate around the clock, pouring forth millions of Mosin rifles, carbines, and artillery rounds for frontline divisions."
+ SOV_partisan_detachments_and_red_guards:0 "Partisan Warfare Behind White Lines"
+ SOV_partisan_detachments_and_red_guards_desc:0 "Bolshevik agitators organize clandestine partisan detachments behind White armies in Siberia and the Ukraine, sabotaging railway bridges, ambushing supply convoys, and demoralizing enemy garrisons."
+ SOV_mass_artillery_concentration:0 "Mass Artillery Concentration"
+ SOV_mass_artillery_concentration_desc:0 "Concentrating heavy artillery brigades into decisive breakthrough sectors overwhelms entrenched White defense works and suppresses enemy counter-battery fire."
+ SOV_red_baltic_fleet_defenses:0 "Red Baltic Fleet Coastal Defenses"
+ SOV_red_baltic_fleet_defenses_desc:0 "The revolutionary sailors of the Baltic Fleet anchor battleships and lay dense minefields to protect the maritime approaches to Petrograd against British naval incursions."
+ SOV_revolutionary_red_air_fleet:0 "Revolutionary Red Air Fleet"
+ SOV_revolutionary_red_air_fleet_desc:0 "Repurposing captured aircraft and establishing aviation detachments gives the Red Army aerial reconnaissance and strafing superiority across vast civil war battlefronts."
+ SOV_frunze_military_reforms:0 "Frunze's Military Reforms"
+ SOV_frunze_military_reforms_desc:0 "Mikhail Frunze introduces unified tactical field regulations, regularizes divisional organization, streamlines logistics, and establishes a peacetime cadre-militia system."
+ SOV_tukhachevsky_operational_art:0 "Tukhachevsky's Deep Operations Theory"
+ SOV_tukhachevsky_operational_art_desc:0 "Pioneering the concept of deep operations, Mikhail Tukhachevsky articulates simultaneous combined-arms strikes throughout the entire depth of the enemy's defensive echelon."
+ SOV_field_communications_and_logistics:0 "Field Communications & Depot Networks"
+ SOV_field_communications_and_logistics_desc:0 "Expanding field telephone wire networks, wireless telegraph stations, and regional supply depots guarantees continuous command cohesion across expansive army groups."
+ SOV_rkka_victorious_red_colossus:0 "Victorious Red Colossus"
+ SOV_rkka_victorious_red_colossus_desc:0 "Tempered in the furnace of civil war and foreign intervention, the Workers' and Peasants' Red Army emerges as an unyielding colossus capable of defending socialism against any capitalist onslaught."
+ SOV_the_goelro_plan:0 "The GOELRO Electrification Plan"
+ SOV_the_goelro_plan_desc:0 "'Communism is Soviet power plus the electrification of the whole country!' The State Commission for the Electrification of Russia maps out nationwide electrical power generation networks."
+ SOV_shaturskaya_power_station:0 "Shatura Peat-Fired Power Station"
+ SOV_shaturskaya_power_station_desc:0 "Harnessing local peat bogs outside Moscow, Shatura becomes an engineering marvel providing clean electrical power to the capital's industrial machinery."
+ SOV_founding_of_gosplan:0 "Founding of Gosplan"
+ SOV_founding_of_gosplan_desc:0 "The State General Planning Commission is created to coordinate all economic production, resource distribution, and capital investment according to scientific, centralized socialist principles."
+ SOV_kashira_and_volkhov_turbines:0 "Kashira and Volkhov Hydro Turbines"
+ SOV_kashira_and_volkhov_turbines_desc:0 "Constructing pioneering regional hydroelectric dams and generating stations powers the recovery of Leningrad's and Moscow's heavy engineering plants."
+ SOV_reopen_the_donbass_coalfields:0 "Rehabilitate the Donbass Coalfields"
+ SOV_reopen_the_donbass_coalfields_desc:0 "Draining flooded mine shafts, clearing debris, and rewarding coal miners restores high-grade coking coal extraction across the Donets Basin to feed blast furnaces."
+ SOV_baku_oil_syndicate:0 "Azneft Baku Oil Syndicate"
+ SOV_baku_oil_syndicate_desc:0 "Nationalized Baku oil operations are unified under Azneft, modernizing rotary drilling equipment and securing essential kerosene, diesel, and lubricants for the national economy."
+ SOV_the_new_economic_policy:0 "The New Economic Policy (NEP)"
+ SOV_the_new_economic_policy_desc:0 "Faced with widespread economic ruin and peasant famine, Lenin introduces a tactical retreat: replacing forced requisitions with free market trade for petty agriculture and handicrafts."
+ SOV_primitive_socialist_accumulation:0 "Primitive Socialist Accumulation"
+ SOV_primitive_socialist_accumulation_desc:0 "Following Preobrazhensky's economic theories, capital surpluses from agriculture and trade are systematically channeled into heavy industrial development without foreign debt."
+ SOV_the_prodnalog_tax_in_kind:0 "The Prodnalog Tax-in-Kind"
+ SOV_the_prodnalog_tax_in_kind_desc:0 "A fixed, predictable agricultural tax replaces arbitrary food confiscation. Peasants are permitted to freely sell remaining grain on open local markets, revitalizing agricultural output."
+ SOV_stabilize_the_soviet_chervonets:0 "Monetary Reform & The Gold Chervonets"
+ SOV_stabilize_the_soviet_chervonets_desc:0 "People's Commissar Sokolnikov introduces the gold-backed Chervonets, ending hyperinflation and restoring confidence in the Soviet monetary system at home and abroad."
+ SOV_state_industrial_monopolies:0 "State Industrial Trusts & Monopolies"
+ SOV_state_industrial_monopolies_desc:0 "While light commerce is decentralized under NEP, the state tenaciously retains the 'commanding heights of the economy'—heavy industry, rail networks, banking, and foreign trade monopolies."
+ SOV_forced_grain_procurements:0 "Urals-Siberian Grain Procurements"
+ SOV_forced_grain_procurements_desc:0 "When grain collections falter, emergency state procurement commissions enforce firm quotas on kulak holdings to sustain industrial construction programs in the cities."
+ SOV_nepmen_and_cooperatives:0 "Consumer Cooperatives & Nepmen"
+ SOV_nepmen_and_cooperatives_desc:0 "Permitting private retailers and expanding rural consumer cooperatives revitalizes internal trade distribution networks while generating vital tax revenues."
+ SOV_foreign_concessions_krupp_hammer:0 "Foreign Concessions: Hammer & Krupp"
+ SOV_foreign_concessions_krupp_hammer_desc:0 "Pragmatically granting mining and manufacturing concessions to foreign entrepreneurs like Armand Hammer and German industrialists secures essential machine tools and technology."
+ SOV_dnieper_hydroelectric_project:0 "Dneproges Hydroelectric Station"
+ SOV_dnieper_hydroelectric_project_desc:0 "Damming the mighty Dnieper rapids constructs Europe's largest hydroelectric power plant, providing abundant electricity to aluminum works and metallurgical complexes in Zaporizhia."
+ SOV_ural_kuznetsk_combine:0 "Ural-Kuznetsk Industrial Combine"
+ SOV_ural_kuznetsk_combine_desc:0 "Pairing Ural iron ore with rich Kuznetsk Basin coking coal establishes an impregnable second metallurgical base deep within the interior of Eurasia, far beyond the reach of imperialist armies."
+ SOV_the_third_international:0 "Founding of the Communist International (Comintern)"
+ SOV_the_third_international_desc:0 "In March 1919, delegates from across the globe gather in Moscow to establish the Third International, uniting revolutionary parties worldwide under Marxist-Leninist leadership."
+ SOV_twenty_one_conditions:0 "The Twenty-One Conditions of Admission"
+ SOV_twenty_one_conditions_desc:0 "Drafted by Lenin, rigorous ideological conditions ensure that member communist parties purge reformists and centrists, adopting iron Bolshevik discipline and clandestine party organs."
+ SOV_support_the_bavarian_and_hungarian_soviets:0 "Aid to Bavarian & Hungarian Soviets"
+ SOV_support_the_bavarian_and_hungarian_soviets_desc:0 "Dispatches of gold, propaganda cadres, and diplomatic coordination seek to break through the Allied encirclement and link hands with the fledgling Soviet Republics in Central Europe."
+ SOV_ignite_the_western_flame:0 "Ignite the Western Proletarian Revolution"
+ SOV_ignite_the_western_flame_desc:0 "Encouraging revolutionary general strikes, mass demonstrations, and mutinies among European workers threatens the capitalist rear guards and undermines foreign intervention."
+ SOV_the_target_vistula_offensive:0 "Over the Corpse of White Poland to Berlin!"
+ SOV_the_target_vistula_offensive_desc:0 "Tukhachevsky drives the Red Army across the Polish borderlands toward Warsaw, aiming to shatter the Versailles treaty system and bring armed proletarian solidarity to the German working class."
+ SOV_anti_imperialist_eastern_bureau:0 "Congress of the Peoples of the East"
+ SOV_anti_imperialist_eastern_bureau_desc:0 "Assembling anti-colonial delegations in Baku, the Comintern calls on millions of oppressed peoples across Asia and the Middle East to wage revolutionary holy war against British and French imperialism."
+ SOV_the_treaty_of_riga_settlement:0 "The Peace of Riga Settlement"
+ SOV_the_treaty_of_riga_settlement_desc:0 "Conceding the immediate impossibility of taking Warsaw, the Soviet Republic concludes a realistic border settlement with Poland, securing diplomatic breathing room to rebuild."
+ SOV_proclaim_the_curzon_line:0 "Proclaim the Curzon Line Frontier"
+ SOV_proclaim_the_curzon_line_desc:0 "Upholding the ethnic demarcation proposed by British Foreign Secretary Lord Curzon establishes legitimate Soviet territorial claims over Western Ukraine and Western Belarus."
+ SOV_aid_to_anatolian_nationalists:0 "Aid to Kemalist Anatolian Forces"
+ SOV_aid_to_anatolian_nationalists_desc:0 "Shipments of Soviet rifles, gold rubles, and artillery pieces to Mustafa Kemal's nationalist army in Ankara disrupt British and French imperialist partition plans in the Near East."
+ SOV_the_genoa_conference_diplomacy:0 "Genoa Economic Conference Diplomacy"
+ SOV_the_genoa_conference_diplomacy_desc:0 "Led by People's Commissar Georgy Chicherin, Soviet diplomacy exploits rivalries between Western powers, refusing Tsarist debt repayments while establishing commercial relations."
+ SOV_treaty_of_rapallo:0 "The Treaty of Rapallo"
+ SOV_treaty_of_rapallo_desc:0 "Meeting secretly at Rapallo, Soviet Russia and Weimar Germany mutually cancel war claims, establish diplomatic ties, and form an economic and military partnership between the two outcasts of Europe."
+ SOV_alliance_with_kuomintang:0 "Alliance with the Kuomintang"
+ SOV_alliance_with_kuomintang_desc:0 "The Sun-Joffe Manifesto cements Soviet partnership with Sun Yat-sen's nationalist movement, sending Mikhail Borodin and military advisers to establish the Whampoa Military Academy."
+ SOV_secret_lipetsk_fighter_school:0 "Secret Lipetsk Fighter Pilot Base"
+ SOV_secret_lipetsk_fighter_school_desc:0 "In clandestine cooperation with the German Reichswehr, a secret aviation school is constructed at Lipetsk, testing advanced aircraft designs and training modern fighter pilots."
+ SOV_kama_tank_proving_grounds:0 "Kama Joint Armored School at Kazan"
+ SOV_kama_tank_proving_grounds_desc:0 "Establishing a secret armored testing facility outside Kazan allows Soviet engineers and German officers to experiment with experimental tank prototypes and mobile warfare doctrines."
+ SOV_tomka_chemical_weapons_testing:0 "Tomka Chemical Warfare Proving Grounds"
+ SOV_tomka_chemical_weapons_testing_desc:0 "Deep within Saratov province, joint military proving grounds test gas masks, decontamination protocols, and aerial chemical weapons dispersal methods in absolute secrecy."
+ SOV_break_the_capitalist_encirclement:0 "Breach the Capitalist Encirclement"
+ SOV_break_the_capitalist_encirclement_desc:0 "By balancing revolutionary solidarity with calculated diplomatic trade agreements, the Soviet Republic fractures the hostile imperialist blockade and secures international recognition."
+ SOV_peoples_commissariat_of_nationalities:0 "People's Commissariat of Nationalities (Narkomnats)"
+ SOV_peoples_commissariat_of_nationalities_desc:0 "Chaired by Joseph Stalin, Narkomnats oversees Bolshevik minority policy, reconciling regional national aspirations with unified socialist statehood."
+ SOV_sovietization_of_ukraine:0 "Sovietization of Ukraine"
+ SOV_sovietization_of_ukraine_desc:0 "Driving out nationalist Rada remnants and White warlords, the Red Army establishes the Ukrainian Soviet Socialist Republic in Kharkiv, reintegrating vital coal and grain resources."
+ SOV_sovietization_of_belarus:0 "Sovietization of Belarus"
+ SOV_sovietization_of_belarus_desc:0 "Reclaiming Minsk from foreign and nationalist factions, the Byelorussian Soviet Socialist Republic is firmly established as a western bastion of workers' power."
+ SOV_red_army_in_the_caucasus:0 "Red Army Operations in the Caucasus"
+ SOV_red_army_in_the_caucasus_desc:0 "Ordzhonikidze and Kirov lead Red Army columns into Baku, Yerevan, and Tbilisi, toppling bourgeois nationalist regimes and securing Caspian oil for Soviet industry."
+ SOV_pacify_the_basmachi_in_turkestan:0 "Pacify the Basmachi Movement in Turkestan"
+ SOV_pacify_the_basmachi_in_turkestan_desc:0 "Combining mobile cavalry patrols with agrarian concessions and Islamic cultural sensitivity neutralizes Enver Pasha's insurgents and pacifies Central Asia."
+ SOV_the_georgian_affair_debate:0 "The Georgian Affair Debate"
+ SOV_the_georgian_affair_debate_desc:0 "A fierce dispute over the degree of local republic autonomy divides Lenin and Stalin, resolving toward a federal structure that preserves the sovereignty of constituent nations."
+ SOV_korenizatsiya_indigenization_policy:0 "Korenizatsiya Indigenization Policy"
+ SOV_korenizatsiya_indigenization_policy_desc:0 "Promoting indigenous national elites, opening local language schools, and publishing newspapers in minority tongues bonds non-Russian peoples to the Soviet state."
+ SOV_treaty_on_the_creation_of_the_ussr:0 "Treaty on the Creation of the USSR"
+ SOV_treaty_on_the_creation_of_the_ussr_desc:0 "On December 30, 1922, the First All-Union Congress of Soviets solemnly ratifies the declaration and treaty creating the Union of Soviet Socialist Republics."
+ SOV_autonomous_soviet_republics:0 "Charter Autonomous Republics (ASSRs)"
+ SOV_autonomous_soviet_republics_desc:0 "Granting autonomous territorial status to smaller nationalities within the Russian SFSR accommodates ethnic diversity while maintaining unified economic and military control."
+ SOV_the_likbez_literacy_campaign:0 "The Likbez Universal Literacy Campaign"
+ SOV_the_likbez_literacy_campaign_desc:0 "'An illiterate person stands outside politics.' Tens of thousands of reading rooms and literacy points (likpunkty) open in factories and villages to eradicate illiteracy across the Union."
+ SOV_the_1924_soviet_constitution:0 "Enactment of the 1924 Soviet Constitution"
+ SOV_the_1924_soviet_constitution_desc:0 "The Second All-Union Congress of Soviets ratifies the fundamental law of the USSR, codifying the federal union of equal republics under the Supreme Soviet and Sovnarkom."
+ SOV_emancipation_of_women_zhenotdel:0 "Zhenotdel: Emancipation of Women"
+ SOV_emancipation_of_women_zhenotdel_desc:0 "Headed by Inessa Armand and Alexandra Kollontai, the Women's Department of the Central Committee establishes equal legal rights, workplace nurseries, and communal dining facilities."
+ SOV_sovnarkom_central_bureaucracy:0 "Consolidation of the Sovnarkom Apparatus"
+ SOV_sovnarkom_central_bureaucracy_desc:0 "Centralized executive departments eliminate parallel bureaucratic friction, streamlining ministerial decisions directly to regional executive committees (ispolkoms)."
+ SOV_the_socialist_fatherland_triumphant:0 "The Socialist Fatherland Triumphant"
+ SOV_the_socialist_fatherland_triumphant_desc:0 "From the ashes of imperial collapse and the trials of civil war, the Union of Soviet Socialist Republics stands as an invincible citadel of world socialism, ready to face the future!"
+ SOV_civil_war_management:0 "Soviet Civil War Administration"
+ SOV_civil_war_management_desc:0 "Emergency wartime directives to feed the cities, mobilize industrial workers, and secure arms for the Red Army."
+ SOV_seize_kazan_gold_reserves:0 "Seize the Imperial Gold Reserves in Kazan"
+ SOV_seize_kazan_gold_reserves_desc:0 "Secure the Imperial State Bank's bullion stored in the vaults of Kazan to finance emergency industrial production and state purchases."
+ SOV_prodrazvyorstka_grain_expeditions:0 "Prodrazvyorstka Grain Expeditions"
+ SOV_prodrazvyorstka_grain_expeditions_desc:0 "Dispatch armed worker and Red Guard detachments into rural provinces to requisition grain quotas and ensure food supply to the frontlines."
+ SOV_mobilize_petrograd_workers:0 "Mobilize Petrograd Industrial Workers"
+ SOV_mobilize_petrograd_workers_desc:0 "Levy workers from the Putilov and Baltic shipyards into armed battalions to reinforce threatened fronts."
+ SOV_trotsky_armored_train_inspection:0 "Trotsky's Armored Train Frontline Inspection"
+ SOV_trotsky_armored_train_inspection_desc:0 "Commissar of War Leon Trotsky travels the frontlines aboard his armored train to restore discipline, inspire revolutionary zeal, and rally retreating divisions."
+ SOV_soviet_diplomacy:0 "Soviet Foreign Diplomacy"
+ SOV_soviet_diplomacy_desc:0 "Diplomatic maneuvers, peace decrees, and revolutionary foreign policy of the Council of People's Commissars."
+ SOV_decree_on_peace:0 "Proclaim the Decree on Peace"
+ SOV_decree_on_peace_desc:0 "Issue an appeal to all warring nations for an immediate democratic peace without annexations or indemnities, opening direct parleys with Berlin."
+ SOV_vecheka_state_security:0 "All-Russian Cheka State Security"
+ SOV_vecheka_state_security_desc:0 "The iron shield and sword of the proletariat maintains relentless vigilance against counter-revolutionary infiltration and sabotage."
+ SOV_militarization_of_labor_spirit:0 "Militarization of the Labor Front"
+ SOV_militarization_of_labor_spirit_desc:0 "Factory regiments and shock brigades work under strict military discipline to ensure unceasing production of armaments."
+ SOV_frunze_unified_doctrine_spirit:0 "Frunze's Unified Military Doctrine"
+ SOV_frunze_unified_doctrine_spirit_desc:0 "Harmonizing revolutionary zeal with structured staff work, divisional standardization, and aggressive operational initiative."
+ SOV_tukhachevsky_deep_operations:0 "Deep Battle Theory"
+ SOV_tukhachevsky_deep_operations_desc:0 "Simultaneous operational strikes throughout the entire depth of the enemy defensive system utilizing shock formations and motorized elements."
+ SOV_goelro_electrification:0 "GOELRO State Electrification"
+ SOV_goelro_electrification_desc:0 "High-voltage transmission grids and regional power stations power industrial machinery and modernize Soviet production."
+ SOV_new_economic_policy_spirit:0 "New Economic Policy (NEP)"
+ SOV_new_economic_policy_spirit_desc:0 "A pragmatic economic framework balancing peasant grain markets with state ownership of key heavy industries."
+ SOV_superindustrialization_spirit:0 "Socialist Industrial Accumulation"
+ SOV_superindustrialization_spirit_desc:0 "Mobilizing all state resources and labor reserves into rapid heavy industrial expansion and infrastructure projects."
+ SOV_comintern_vanguard:0 "Vanguard of the Communist International"
+ SOV_comintern_vanguard_desc:0 "Moscow stands as the guiding star for the worldwide communist vanguard and the global struggle against imperialism."
+ SOV_rapallo_cooperation:0 "Rapallo Commercial & Technical Accords"
+ SOV_rapallo_cooperation_desc:0 "Bilateral cooperation with Germany secures specialized tooling, engineering blueprints, and joint military testing facilities."
+ SOV_union_of_soviet_socialist_republics:0 "Union of Soviet Socialist Republics"
+ SOV_union_of_soviet_socialist_republics_desc:0 "A fraternal union of equal socialist republics founded upon collective labor, proletarian solidarity, and common defense."
diff --git a/WW1/localisation/english/ww1_white_l_english.yml b/WW1/localisation/english/ww1_white_l_english.yml
