@@ -0,0 +1,189 @@
+﻿l_english:
+ WHT_ufa_state_conference:0 "The Ufa State Conference"
+ WHT_ufa_state_conference_desc:0 "Delegates from regional anti-Bolshevik governments, the Komuch, and municipal dumas assemble in Ufa to declare a single All-Russian Provisional Government."
+ WHT_czechoslovak_legion_alliance:0 "Alliance with the Czechoslovak Legion"
+ WHT_czechoslovak_legion_alliance_desc:0 "Forming an operational military alliance with fifty thousand battle-hardened Czechoslovak legionaries secures the vital railway corridor across the Urals and Siberia."
+ WHT_omsk_directorate:0 "The Omsk Provisional Directorate"
+ WHT_omsk_directorate_desc:0 "Transferring the seat of supreme authority to Omsk establishes an administrative nucleus to govern the liberated eastern territories and prepare state administration."
+ WHT_trans_siberian_logistics:0 "Guard the Trans-Siberian Railway"
+ WHT_trans_siberian_logistics_desc:0 "Guarding seven thousand versts of railway tracks with armored patrols, fortified watchtowers, and repair battalions guarantees our lifeline to Pacific ports."
+ WHT_seize_kazan_gold:0 "Secure the Imperial Gold Reserve at Kazan"
+ WHT_seize_kazan_gold_desc:0 "Capturing hundreds of tons of imperial gold bullion deposited in Kazan provides collateral to purchase foreign arms, uniforms, and ammunition from the Allied powers."
+ WHT_kolchak_supreme_ruler:0 "Admiral Kolchak: Supreme Ruler of Russia"
+ WHT_kolchak_supreme_ruler_desc:0 "Following a patriotic coup d'état in Omsk, Admiral Alexander Kolchak is proclaimed Supreme Ruler of the Russian State and Supreme Commander-in-Chief of all land and naval forces."
+ WHT_pepelyayev_siberian_corps:0 "Pepelyayev's Siberian Army Corps"
+ WHT_pepelyayev_siberian_corps_desc:0 "General Anatoly Pepelyayev's resilient Siberian rifle formations brave blizzards and rough terrain, becoming the vanguard of our advance across the snowy Urals."
+ WHT_ural_industrial_complex:0 "The Ural Arsenal & Munitions Works"
+ WHT_ural_industrial_complex_desc:0 "Mobilizing the metallurgical works and arms factories of Perm, Zlatoust, and Chelyabinsk provides domestic artillery shells and small-arms ammunition for our divisions."
+ WHT_siberian_mobilization:0 "General Mobilization of Siberia"
+ WHT_siberian_mobilization_desc:0 "Levying peasant conscripts and veteran Cossacks across Tomsk, Tobolsk, and Irkutsk expands the Siberian Army into a multi-corps operational force."
+ WHT_siberian_river_flotillas:0 "Kama and Ob River Armed Flotillas"
+ WHT_siberian_river_flotillas_desc:0 "Arming steam tugs and barges with naval artillery dominates the inland waterways, shielding army flanks and providing amphibious artillery fire support."
+ WHT_siberian_fortifications:0 "Chelyabinsk & Ural Defense Lines"
+ WHT_siberian_fortifications_desc:0 "Digging reinforced redoubts and trench networks along the mountain passes of the Urals secures our rear logistics in case of temporary tactical reverses."
+ WHT_purge_socialist_revolutionaries:0 "Suppress Socialist-Revolutionary Agitation"
+ WHT_purge_socialist_revolutionaries_desc:0 "Disbanding radical committees and repressing Socialist-Revolutionary intrigue eliminates subversive dual power within our military administration."
+ WHT_omsk_cadet_corps:0 "The Omsk Officers & Cadets Academy"
+ WHT_omsk_cadet_corps_desc:0 "Establishing military colleges in Omsk trains thousands of devoted young cadets to replace fallen frontline platoon and company commanders."
+ WHT_ural_offensive:0 "Launch the Spring Ural Offensive"
+ WHT_ural_offensive_desc:0 "Admiral Kolchak orders our western armies to advance over the Ural mountains toward the Volga, aiming to link up with Denikin's forces driving from the South."
+ WHT_great_siberian_march:0 "Heroism of the Great Siberian Ice March"
+ WHT_great_siberian_march_desc:0 "Retreating through sub-zero Siberian blizzards across frozen Lake Baikal tempers White soldiers with iron endurance and an unshakeable spirit of sacrifice."
+ WHT_first_kuban_campaign:0 "The First Kuban Campaign (Ice March)"
+ WHT_first_kuban_campaign_desc:0 "General Kornilov leads four thousand volunteers into the freezing steppes of the Kuban. Though outnumbered, this legendary march establishes the immortal soul of the White Movement."
+ WHT_volunteer_army_mobilization:0 "Volunteer Army Mobilization"
+ WHT_volunteer_army_mobilization_desc:0 "Patriotic university students, imperial military academy cadets, and loyalist officers flock to the Don to take up arms against the red plague."
+ WHT_denikin_assumes_command:0 "General Denikin Assumes Supreme Command"
+ WHT_denikin_assumes_command_desc:0 "Following Kornilov's tragic death before Ekaterinodar, General Anton Denikin takes the helm, rebuilding the army with methodical operational planning."
+ WHT_cossack_hosts_federation:0 "Pact with Don & Kuban Cossack Hosts"
+ WHT_cossack_hosts_federation_desc:0 "Concluding military alliances with the Don Ataman Krasnov and the Kuban Rada integrates tens of thousands of peerless cavalrymen into the White frontline."
+ WHT_colored_officer_regiments:0 "Elite 'Colored' Officer Regiments"
+ WHT_colored_officer_regiments_desc:0 "The Kornilov Shock, Markov, Drozdovsky, and Alekseyev regiments—famed for their distinct colored caps and chevron badges—fight with suicidal valor as frontline assault troops."
+ WHT_armed_forces_of_south_russia:0 "Armed Forces of South Russia (VSYUR)"
+ WHT_armed_forces_of_south_russia_desc:0 "Uniting the Volunteer Army, the Don Cossack Army, and the Crimean-Azov forces creates a grand operational coalition under General Denikin's banner."
+ WHT_don_and_kuban_cavalry_corps:0 "Mammontov & Shkuro's Cossack Cavalry"
+ WHT_don_and_kuban_cavalry_corps_desc:0 "Dashing cavalry corps under Generals Konstantin Mammontov and Andrei Shkuro conduct deep raiding raids behind enemy lines, routing Soviet supply depots."
+ WHT_armored_train_flotillas:0 "White Armored Trains: 'General Kornilov'"
+ WHT_armored_train_flotillas_desc:0 "Armored steam locomotives mounting heavy naval guns and machine gun turrets spearhead our advance along rail junctions, smashing enemy resistance."
+ WHT_moscow_directive:0 "Denikin's Moscow Directive"
+ WHT_moscow_directive_desc:0 "'Aiming at the heart of Russia: Moscow.' General Denikin issues Directive No. 08878 ordering an all-out advance via Kursk and Orel toward the Kremlin."
+ WHT_tarki_and_terek_pacification:0 "Pacify the Terek & Northern Caucasus"
+ WHT_tarki_and_terek_pacification_desc:0 "Securing the mineral-rich Terek river basin and pacifying high mountain gorges protects our rear from Bolshevik mountain insurgents and secures Caspian communications."
+ WHT_black_sea_squadron:0 "Reorganize the White Black Sea Squadron"
+ WHT_black_sea_squadron_desc:0 "Refitting cruisers and destroyers in Sevastopol enables naval bombardments along coastal railroads and secures sea lines of communication."
+ WHT_wrangel_land_reform:0 "Wrangel's Agrarian Land Order"
+ WHT_wrangel_land_reform_desc:0 "General Baron Pyotr Wrangel issues a pragmatic land decree transferring land to working peasants in return for modest payments, winning rural hearts and minds."
+ WHT_black_baron_offensive:0 "The 'Black Baron' Taurida Counter-Offensive"
+ WHT_black_baron_offensive_desc:0 "Donning his black Cossack chokha, General Wrangel leads sudden, lethal armored and cavalry strikes out of the Crimean peninsula into the rich steppes of Northern Taurida."
+ WHT_crimean_redoubt:0 "Fortify the Perekop Isthmus & Chongar"
+ WHT_crimean_redoubt_desc:0 "Constructing deep trenches, concrete pillboxes, and barbed-wire obstacles along the narrow bottlenecks of Perekop and Chongar transforms Crimea into an impregnable fortress."
+ WHT_tsaritsyn_bridgehead:0 "Capture the Red Verdun: Tsaritsyn"
+ WHT_tsaritsyn_bridgehead_desc:0 "Wrangel's coordinated assault with tanks and heavy artillery takes the strategic Volga fortress of Tsaritsyn, cutting Soviet fuel and grain transport from the Caucasus."
+ WHT_russian_army_reorganization:0 "Wrangel's Reorganized Russian Army"
+ WHT_russian_army_reorganization_desc:0 "Purging demoralized commanders and instilling iron discipline transforms the retreating remnants of the South into the elite, resolute Russian Army."
+ WHT_allied_supreme_war_council_appeal:0 "Appeal to Allied Supreme War Council"
+ WHT_allied_supreme_war_council_appeal_desc:0 "Direct diplomatic appeals to London, Paris, and Washington demand that the Entente honor its wartime alliance with Russia by providing munitions and naval assistance."
+ WHT_general_knox_british_mission:0 "British Military Mission under General Knox"
+ WHT_general_knox_british_mission_desc:0 "General Alfred Knox oversees deliveries of hundreds of thousands of British Lee-Enfield rifles, machine guns, uniforms, and military advisers to equip loyalist armies in Siberia."
+ WHT_french_black_sea_mission:0 "French Naval Mission in the Black Sea"
+ WHT_french_black_sea_mission_desc:0 "French naval forces under General Franchet d'Espèrey anchor in Odessa and Sevastopol, unloading ammunition crates, medical supplies, and artillery shells."
+ WHT_japanese_siberian_liaison:0 "Liaison with Japanese Expeditionary Forces"
+ WHT_japanese_siberian_liaison_desc:0 "Coordinating security protocols along the Amur and Ussuri railways with Japanese expeditionary troops keeps the Far East supply channel open."
+ WHT_british_vickers_and_enfield_supplies:0 "British Vickers & Enfield Deliveries"
+ WHT_british_vickers_and_enfield_supplies_desc:0 "Equipping White regiments with modern British water-cooled Vickers machine guns and high-caliber ammunition provides firepower superiority on the front."
+ WHT_murmansk_and_arkhangelsk_bridgehead:0 "North Russian Bridgehead: Arkhangelsk"
+ WHT_murmansk_and_arkhangelsk_bridgehead_desc:0 "Under General Miller, White Northern Army units coordinate with British and American forces at Archangelsk and Murmansk to threaten the Bolshevik northern flank."
+ WHT_american_railroad_corps:0 "Stevens' Russian Railway Service Corps"
+ WHT_american_railroad_corps_desc:0 "American railway engineers under John F. Stevens repair telegraph lines, optimize locomotive dispatching, and overhaul roundhouses along the Trans-Siberian."
+ WHT_heavy_mark_v_tanks:0 "British Heavy Mark V & Whippet Tanks"
+ WHT_heavy_mark_v_tanks_desc:0 "Deploying British-supplied Mark V composite and Whippet medium tanks strikes terror into red infantry lines and smashes fortified trench sectors."
+ WHT_royal_navy_black_sea_escorts:0 "Royal Navy Gunboat Escorts"
+ WHT_royal_navy_black_sea_escorts_desc:0 "British destroyers and monitors patrol the Sea of Azov and Kerch Strait, preventing enemy amphibious landings and screening our ports."
+ WHT_renault_ft_tanks:0 "French Renault FT-17 Light Tanks"
+ WHT_renault_ft_tanks_desc:0 "Agile French Renault FT-17 light tanks with fully rotating turrets provide close infantry support during urban fighting and breakthrough assaults."
+ WHT_air_service_sopwith_camels:0 "RAF Sopwith Camels & DH.9 Bombers"
+ WHT_air_service_sopwith_camels_desc:0 "British-supplied Sopwith Camel pursuits and Airco DH.9 light bombers provide White aviators with aerial reconnaissance and frontline strafing capabilities."
+ WHT_paris_peace_conference_delegation:0 "Russian Delegation at Paris Conference"
+ WHT_paris_peace_conference_delegation_desc:0 "Distinguished diplomats under Sergey Sazonov represent Russian imperial interests at the Paris Peace Conference, lobbying for territorial integrity and financial recognition."
+ WHT_trans_pacific_credit_lines:0 "Trans-Pacific Financial Credit Lines"
+ WHT_trans_pacific_credit_lines_desc:0 "Securing international banking credits backed by our Siberian gold reserves finances sustained arms imports from American and Japanese manufacturing concerns."
+ WHT_western_military_academies:0 "Allied Advisory Missions & Academies"
+ WHT_western_military_academies_desc:0 "British, French, and Allied staff officers conduct modern staff college courses for White lieutenants, instilling modern combined-arms doctrine."
+ WHT_entente_arsenal_of_liberation:0 "The Entente Arsenal of Liberation"
+ WHT_entente_arsenal_of_liberation_desc:0 "Massive foreign logistical pipelines provide the material muscle to re-arm our divisions from head to toe, preparing our ultimate offensive to reclaim Russia."
+ WHT_russia_one_and_indivisible:0 "Russia, One and Indivisible!"
+ WHT_russia_one_and_indivisible_desc:0 "The foundational dogma of the White Movement: the sacred territorial integrity of the Russian State is indivisible and inviolable across Europe and Asia."
+ WHT_constituent_assembly:0 "Pledge to Convene Constituent Assembly"
+ WHT_constituent_assembly_desc:0 "Promising to summon a freely elected All-Russian Constituent Assembly once Moscow is liberated wins over democratic, liberal, and moderate socialist patriots."
+ WHT_military_dictatorship:0 "Supreme Military Dictatorship: Iron Rule"
+ WHT_military_dictatorship_desc:0 "Recognizing that parliamentary debate invites paralysis, supreme executive power is vested in a military dictator with unbending authority to restore civil order."
+ WHT_broad_coalition_duma:0 "Broad National Coalition Duma"
+ WHT_broad_coalition_duma_desc:0 "Uniting Kadets, Octobrists, and patriotic right-wing figures into an advisory national council builds civilian consensus behind the war effort."
+ WHT_okhrana_restoration:0 "Restore State Gendarmerie & Security"
+ WHT_okhrana_restoration_desc:0 "Re-establishing specialized security police and military counter-intelligence detachments ruthlessly roots out communist agitators, spies, and deserters."
+ WHT_restoration_of_the_monarchy:0 "Manifesto on Monarchist Restoration"
+ WHT_restoration_of_the_monarchy_desc:0 "Drafting a sacred manifesto proclaiming the revival of Orthodox Tsardom restores the ancestral covenant between the Russian people and the throne."
+ WHT_zemstvo_self_governance:0 "Decentralized Zemstvo Self-Governance"
+ WHT_zemstvo_self_governance_desc:0 "Restoring provincial Zemstvos and municipal councils ensures democratic civic administration over schools, roads, medical relief, and local justice."
+ WHT_reconstruction_of_devastated_lands:0 "Rebuild Devastated War Provinces"
+ WHT_reconstruction_of_devastated_lands_desc:0 "Allocating state reconstruction loans repairs blown railway bridges, reopens flooded coal mines, and rebuilds scorched towns across the country."
+ WHT_crowned_regency_council:0 "Crowned Regency Council"
+ WHT_crowned_regency_council_desc:0 "Appointing a Council of Regency under Grand Duke Nicholas Nikolayevich guides the state until a National Zemsky Sobor settles the legitimate succession."
+ WHT_free_peasant_proprietorship:0 "Guarantee Peasant Land Titles"
+ WHT_free_peasant_proprietorship_desc:0 "Legally guaranteeing that land acquired by working peasant proprietors will not be confiscated by former landlords wins the enduring allegiance of rural Russia."
+ WHT_national_reconciliation_decree:0 "Decree of National Reconciliation"
+ WHT_national_reconciliation_decree_desc:0 "Granting an amnesty to rank-and-file Red Army conscripts who lay down their weapons heals the bitter wounds of fraternal fratricide."
+ WHT_loyalist_officer_privileges:0 "Honors for Veteran White Officers"
+ WHT_loyalist_officer_privileges_desc:0 "Conferring land grants, state pensions, and imperial honors upon veteran officers rewards their immortal sacrifice in preserving the honor of Russia."
+ WHT_all_russian_reunification:0 "All-Russian National Congress of Victory"
+ WHT_all_russian_reunification_desc:0 "With the red hydra vanquished and the Kremlin liberated, representatives of all Russian lands gather to celebrate the redemption of the Fatherland."
+ WHT_reunify_the_russian_state:0 "Proclaim the Reunited Russian State"
+ WHT_reunify_the_russian_state_desc:0 "The civil war is won! The Russian State stands unified, indivisible, and redeemed under the historic white, blue, and red tricolor!"
